# Dependencies
# Keep this repo OUT of an iCloud-synced path (~/Desktop, ~/Documents with
# Desktop & Documents sync on). iCloud evicts file contents on demand and leaves
# a zero-block placeholder behind: the size is right, the bytes are gone, and
# Node reads it as truncated. It cost a full day here — 540 evicted files in
# node_modules broke the suite with "Class extends value #<Object> is not a
# constructor", and 21 evicted files in the repo itself (DATABASE_TRACKER.md,
# cam_crm_schema.sql) failed 5 migration tests that had nothing wrong with them.
# git reports the tree clean throughout, because the content is in the index.
node_modules
node_modules.nosync/

